title 'Build Your Own Dataset'
display_name 'Build Your Own Dataset'
bubble_choice_description 'Pick any two categories and search for images to populate your dataset'

markdown <<MARKDOWN
## Build Your Own Dataset

1. [Open this document](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1T9J1A7aBCu9Eloew_Cn-DOAqFtyEiMrcrd0U3DVL83Y/edit?usp=sharing) to access a blank dataset template in Google Docs.
2. Go to **File → Make a copy** to make your own copy of the dataset template.
3. Search for at least six images for each of your two categories. Add each image to your document. Label each image with an image number and the category name.
4. Look at your questions from Step 2 of the Project Planning Guide. Think about how well they work for the images in your dataset. Add or edit questions on the list based on your observations.

MARKDOWN
